   "subject": "unbouted + bouted not equalling total",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi Vincent, <div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve used bout.metric = 4 but I&#39;m finding that unbouted time + bouted time in not equal to total time in part5_day_summary_MM_L30M1000V400_T5A5. </div><div><br></div><div>Eg. </div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"160\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:120pt\">\r\n\r\n <span width=\"160\" style=\"width:120pt\"></span>\r\n <span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\">\r\n  <span height=\"20\" width=\"160\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:120pt\"><br>dur_day_IN_unbt_min + </span></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"164\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:123pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" width=\"164\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:123pt\">dur_day_IN_bts_30_min + </span></span></span><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"194\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:146pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" width=\"194\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:146pt\">dur_day_IN_bts_10_30_min + </span></span></span><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"190\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:143pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" width=\"190\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:143pt\">dur_day_IN_bts_1_10_min:</span></span></span><br>65.583 + </span></span></span><span style=\"text-align:right\">334.917 + </span>104.917 + 69.667 = 575.084</div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"166\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:125pt\"><span width=\"166\" style=\"width:125pt\"></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" width=\"166\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:125pt\">but dur_day_total_IN_min  = </span></span><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"min-height:15pt\">547.833</span>\r\n </span>\r\n\r\n</span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"166\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:125pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"166\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:125pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"86\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:65pt\">\r\n <span width=\"86\" style=\"width:65pt\"></span>\r\n <span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\">\r\n\r\n  <span height=\"20\" width=\"86\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:65pt\"><br>dur_day_LIG_unbt_min + </span></span></span></span></span></span>dur_day_LIG_bts_10_min + dur_day_LIG_bts_1_10_min</div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"86\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:65pt\"><span height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><span height=\"20\" align=\"right\" width=\"86\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:65pt\">86 + 10.083 + 75.167 = 171.25</span></span></span></div><div>but dur_day_total_LIG_min = 191.75</div><div><br></div><div>Kind regards, </div><div><br></div><div>Chloe </div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "oVj-5MACCwAJ",
   "from": "Vincent van Hees",
   "author": "017566be30afa7f3",
   "date": "2025-01-17T08:30:12Z",
   "subject": "Re: [GGIR] unbouted + bouted not equalling total",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Hi Chloe,</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Parameter bout.metric was deprecated several years ago, so you can ignore it. GGIR only has one bout detection algorithm and this comes with a variety of parameters (bout duration, bout threshold, and the criteria on the fraction of time that needs to meet the threshold criteria).</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Total inactivity time represents the total number of epochs that individually meet the threshold criteria for inactivity.</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">When summing up the individual inactivity behaviours (bouts, unbouted) please be aware that:</div><div><ul style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><li style=\"list-style-type:&quot;- &quot;\"><span>If <a href=\"http://boutcriter.in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://boutcriter.in&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488813525000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LrU0-ph9Xc_lUWggVp_o5\">boutcriter.in</a> is not 1 then inactivity bouts may include small gaps representing activity behaviours that are counted as inactivity because they are part of inactivity bouts. However, these epochs are not part of total inactivity time even though they are counted towards time in the inactivity bouts.</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type:&quot;- &quot;\"><span><span style=\"display:inline!important;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">If boutcriter.lig or boutcriter.mvpa is not 1 then LIPA or MVPA bouts may include small gaps representing inactive behaviour that is counted towards those bouts. However, these epochs are counted towards total inactivity time.</span><br></span></li></ul><div><span style=\"display:inline!important;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"display:inline!important;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\">As a result </span><span style=\"display:inline!important\"><span style=\"display:inline!important;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\">dur_day_total_IN_min and the sum of the individual class are not identical and provide complementary information. The first one ignores the whole concept of bouts and assesses each epoch individually while the second approach sticks with the bout detection approach.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Kind regards,</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Vincent</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">\r\n    <div>\r\n        <div><div><br></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(107,107,107)\">Dr. Vincent van Hees | Independent consultant | </span><a title=\"https://accelting.com/\" href=\"https://accelting.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://accelting.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488813525000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ddb7nVArFOtdoSI3jCaM2\">https://accelting.com/</a><br></div><div><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/RpackageGGIR/attach/b02c0e4fe58a1/image?part=0.1.1&amp;view=1\"><br></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    \r\n            <div>\r\n        \r\n            </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div>\r\n        On Thursday, 16 January 2025 at 12:40 PM, Chloe Hinchliffe &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">chloehi...@hotmail.co.uk</a>&gt; wrote:<br>\r\n        </div>"
