     3,
     "<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n            Hi Vincent, <div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve used bout.metric = 4 but I&#39;m finding that unbouted time + bouted time in not equal to total time in part5_day_summary_MM_L30M1000V400_T5A5. </div><div><br></div><div>Eg. </div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:120pt\" width=\"160\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n\r\n <span style=\"width:120pt\" width=\"160\"></span>\r\n <span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\">\r\n  <span style=\"min-height:15pt;width:120pt\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\"><br>dur_day_IN_unbt_min + </span></span><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" align=\"right\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:123pt\" width=\"164\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt;width:123pt\" width=\"164\" height=\"20\">dur_day_IN_bts_30_min + </span></span></span><span style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:146pt\" width=\"194\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt;width:146pt\" width=\"194\" height=\"20\">dur_day_IN_bts_10_30_min + </span></span></span><span style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:143pt\" width=\"190\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt;width:143pt\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\">dur_day_IN_bts_1_10_min:</span></span></span><br>65.583 + </span></span></span><span style=\"text-align:right\">334.917 + </span>104.917 + 69.667 = 575.084</div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:125pt\" width=\"166\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><span style=\"width:125pt\" width=\"166\"></span><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt;width:125pt\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\">but dur_day_total_IN_min  = </span></span><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" align=\"right\" height=\"20\">547.833</span>\r\n </span>\r\n\r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:125pt\" width=\"166\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" align=\"right\" height=\"20\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:125pt\" width=\"166\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" align=\"right\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:65pt\" width=\"86\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n <span style=\"width:65pt\" width=\"86\"></span>\r\n <span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\">\r\n\r\n  <span style=\"min-height:15pt;width:65pt\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\"><br>dur_day_LIG_unbt_min + </span></span></span></span></span></span>dur_day_LIG_bts_10_min + dur_day_LIG_bts_1_10_min</div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:65pt\" width=\"86\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"min-height:15pt;width:65pt\" width=\"86\" align=\"right\" height=\"20\">86 + 10.083 + 75.167 = 171.25</span></span></span></div><div>but dur_day_total_LIG_min = 191.75</div><div><br></div><div>Kind regards, </div><div><br></div><div>Chloe </div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
